{'symbol': 'CINF', 'date': '2021-11-19 14:19:00', 'title': 'CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': "CINCINNATI, NOV. 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CINF) ANNOUNCED THAT AT TODAY'S REGULAR MEETING, THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A 63-CENTS-PER-SHARE REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND. THE\xa0DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JANUARY 14, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF DECEMBER 16, 2021."}